,6463,'Art auctioneer. But I’m totally not pursuing it haha',1),(41,6464,'Am having my dream job atm but, wondering if id be able to succeed in this position with the new division',1),(41,6491,'Adakah bakat di diriku yg bisa diseriusin untuk mnjd pnghasilan? Krna aku sedang mncari hal lain selain kantoran',1),(41,6635,'Halo ko, Tracy is back with her other repetitive question (dah kaya radio rusak gw kali ya). Semoga ko Kevin ngga capek baca ceritaku ya... :\')\r\n\r\nA little background ya ko, it\'s been my lifelong dream to publish my own book (since I was 10). Cuma ya dr dlu banyak mimpi doang, I never really went for it. \r\n\r\nNow is perhaps the closest I\'ve ever been to start my own book sejak ngambil project children storybook. Although my client, my english speaking friends and boyfriend like my writing, tapi kan aku udah baca banyak banget karya orang ya. I feel like my writing is not yet on par with the \"standard\" of published novels these days. I tend to be really hard on myself when it comes to creative work, and hold a ridiculously high standard. I do get satisfied with some of my work, but only after they went through long revisions and edits. I dont know whether I actually have the talent for it, or do I have to work 5x harder and longer to produce that quality of writing (some people seem to write so effortlessly...)\r\n\r\nI also have some works in progress that have been sitting in my google drive for the past 5 years...\r\n\r\nTo publish a book is every writer\'s dream, including me. My version of success as a writer is to see lots of people enjoying my book and how my work can inspire new writers and makes them think, “wow I wanna write like Tracy”. If this happens, it will overwhelm me with happiness like, “anjir kalau gw mati sekarang pun I have no regrets sih.\" Urusan cuan sih belakangan buat aku yah when it comes to passion, so this wont be my full time work for now.  \r\n\r\nSo my question is: will I achieve my version of success in the future? It\'s ok if its still 10 years from now, 20 years from now. I\'ve been writing for 10 years anyway, another 10 to 20 years is no biggie for me HAHA\r\n\r\nThank you yaa ko, and have a good day!',1),(41,6770,'Tidak tahu mau dibidang apa, tapi saya mengimpikan pekerjaan yg fleksibel, saya bisa kemana2 tnpa menggangu pekerjaan saya',1),(41,6806,'Menjadi CEO dari salah satu perusahaan,\r\nmemiliki banyak usaha',1),(41,6813,'Bergerak di bidang mental health seperti facilitator atau konselor dan memiliki bisnis kuliner',1),(41,6932,NULL,1),(41,6979,'Perkerjaan impian bisa menjadi pembisnis sukses…\r\nNamun sekarang ini masi tidak tau apa passion dalam diri',1),(41,7047,'dokter',1),(41,7128,'Tidak tau pekerjaan impiannya apa, merasa stuck tidak berkembang jadi minder dengan teman sebaya yang sudah sukses kerja sesuai passion. Jadi meragukan diri sendiri lagi dengan apa yg sudah diusahakan',1),(41,7152,'Apa bakat ku',1),(41,7154,'Fashion designer',1),(41,7170,'Sejujurnya bingung jawabnya karena masih mencari, tapi aku tertarik ke pekerjaan kantoran di industri yang tidak merusak lingkungan/kesehatan, yang sesekali perlu business trip dengan jobdesc yang melibatkan analisis, planning, dll bersama tim (bukan solo fighter)',1),(41,7290,'manager HSE',1),(41,7293,'Saya dosen yang saat ini sedang studi s3. Saya ingin berkembang baik karir maupun rejeki dr dunia akademis dan riset',1),(41,7299,'Perawat profesional, kerja di luar negeri (now working in Japan), bisnis properti(50%).',1),(41,7305,NULL,1),(41,7307,NULL,1),(41,7313,'Psikolog klinis/psikolog forensik',1),(41,7366,'A witch',1),(41,7379,'penulis, dosen, podcaster, pns, youtuber',1),(41,7410,'Astrologer / a job where I can create / heal / nurture',1),(41,7415,'I\'m currently an art director, and I really wish in 5-10 years from now on I could build my own agency',1),(41,7418,'Sesuatu yang dapat memberikan impact baik langsung maupun tidak langsung terhadap orang lain. I have interest in history and culture.',1),(41,7419,'Something in art or makeup/skincare',1),(41,7431,'Hi kak, mau tnya utk bakat saya cocok di bidang apa? Background pendidikan di design komunikasi visual, kerjaan sekarang olshop sparepart (sekalian bantu usaha bokap).  Some other time, saya berminat d bidang voice actress.  Hanya saat ini kondisi sedang ragu dgn diri. Trims kak',1),(41,7433,'an artist or graphic designer',1),(41,7435,'Buka toko bakery/katerinh jadi chef \r\nYang tidak stay di kantor, di depan komputer',1),(41,7489,'Full time business man',1),(41,7495,'Memiliki bisnis yang memberikan dampak terhadap kehidupan orang banyak',1),(41,7535,'My dream job is to be an illustrator (specifically for children\'s books) and having my personally-designed merchandises produced.',1),(41,7538,'House Wife with many passive income! ☺️',1),(41,7544,'Sekarang menghandle bisnis keluarga sendiri. Jadi Saya masih employee. Kemudian bakat terpendam saya dimana ya ? Sebaiknya buka bisnis sendiri? Tapi saya juga ragu saya bisa. Jadi impian saya jadi pengusaha dari usaha sendiri.',1),(41,7585,'Entrepreneur menyambi pegawai kantoran (yang ga terlalu heboh kaya kerjaan sekarang).',1),(41,7590,'My dream job? Maybe something that makes money work for me, not the other way around. I am looking for that balanced share of work and personal life, although many says it\'s a utopia. Currently, I\'m one of the chief editors in a sports organization, leading a small team of other writers and social media executives. But I am also a traveller at heart, who loves to explore and to find meanings in places I\'ve been or experienced.',1),(41,7625,'Professional gaming player, e-sports',1),(41,7639,'Honestly, i don\'t know. Aku lg di tahap dimana aku merasa tidak punya skill apapun, so i hope dapet pencerahan ataupun guideline :)',1),(41,7647,'posisi saat ini sebagai karyawan, sesuai pekerjaan saat ini lebih cocok dibagian apa? kalau jalanin bisnis akan gimana yaa?',1),(41,7671,NULL,1),(41,7730,NULL,1),(41,7738,'Dokter',1),(41,7786,'lulu